  "executive_briefing": "The digital asset sector stands at a critical juncture as the U.S. Senate prepares for the September 15, 2026 vote on the CLARITY Act (H.R. 3633). Institutional Bitcoin adoption through spot ETFs has surpassed $100B in AUM, maturing into standard portfolio rebalancing rather than speculative rushes. Concurrently, regulatory clarity from the CLARITY Act is enabling native Bitcoin smart contract execution, positioning BTC-anchored dApps as direct competitors to Ethereum's EVM ecosystem. Meanwhile, intent-based cross-chain liquidity architectures and non-custodial tools are effectively mitigating bridge security risks across BTC, ETH, and non-EVM networks.",
